# jniLibs intentionally tracked on this fork (nanodesk-keepalive-fix) — the
# upstream repo excludes it, which meant a build from this public source had
# no working tar/zstd/proot/busybox at all (every bootstrap symlink pointed
# at a missing file). Populated from the official v4.2.3-alpha1 release APK's
# own lib/arm64-v8a/*.so, same GPLv3 project, personal-fork use only.
